Package: yunmai-noble
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Vanuan <vanuan@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, dbus, fontconfig, libc6 (>= @LIBC@), libfreetype6, libgcc-s1, libxau6, libxcb-xkb1, libxcb1, libxdmcp6, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: bluez, fonts-dejavu-core, libgl1 | libvulkan1
Suggests: nodejs (>= 22)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Bluetooth scale service and desktop dashboard
 Yunmai Noble reads Yunmai Bluetooth scales through BlueZ over D-Bus,
 stores measurements in SQLite, and serves a web dashboard and JSON/SSE
 API from a single Bun process.
 .
 This package installs the yunmai-noble systemd service, a bundled Bun
 runtime, the web assets, and the GPUI desktop client. The service runs
 as the unprivileged yunmai user and keeps its database in
 /var/lib/yunmai-noble.
